     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Condensing with purpose",
     "texto": [
      "An executive summary opens with the decision or finding, selects only the necessary data and closes with a recommendation and a limit. Nominalisation (**kostnadsøkning**, cost increase) compacts information, but avoid dense sentences that hide agents or causes."
     ],
